
Kafka topic creation — CAB approval (Data Engineering quick reference)

Use this when requesting a new Kafka topic that requires SaaS Change Approval Board (CAB) sign-off. DevOps / Team Keel provisions topics after approval.


Who to ping

    DevOps / Team Keel — Kafka platform owners; they provision topics after CAB approval.
        Keel stakeholder for Kafka: Sravani Goriparthi

    #team-eng-saas-cab — first stop for questions and getting on the CAB agenda.
        Confluence: SaaS Change Approval Board (CAB)
        https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SAAS/pages/395871714/SaaS+Change+Approval+Board+CAB

    Dattu Marneni — Data stakeholder in Kafka Guild (internal ally for Data Engineering).

    #eng-architecture — required for Entity Topic ALT / architecture review before CAB.
        https://sailpoint.slack.com/archives/C063FQJ8J48


CAB schedule

    Tuesdays @ 8:35a CT
    Thursdays @ 3:05p CT

    Add your request to the SaaS Change Approval Board (CAB) agenda before the meeting.
    For urgent approval when you cannot wait for the next meeting, ask in #team-eng-saas-cab for async CAB review.


Process overview

    Choose the path that matches your topic type:


Path A — Entity topic (separate, more involved)

    1. Complete the Entity Topic Creation — CAB Approval Checklist:
       https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/data/pages/5265162375/Entity+Topic+Creation+CAB+Approval+Checklist

    2. Get ALT / Entity Topic Review first — post in #eng-architecture for approval.

    3. After architecture approval, add the request to the CAB agenda and attend a CAB session.

    Related Confluence (entity topics):
        Producing and Owning an Entity Topic
        https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/data/pages/4205970165/Producing+and+Owning+an+Entity+Topic

        Entity Topic Implementation Checklist
        https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/data/pages/4253614219/Entity+Topic+Implementation+Checklist

        So you want to create an entity topic
        https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SAAS/pages/2599158328/So+you+want+to+create+an+entity+topic...


Path B — Regular (non-entity) topic

    1. Add an entry to the SaaS Change Approval Board (CAB) agenda:
       https://sailpoint.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/SAAS/pages/395871714/SaaS+Change+Approval+Board+CAB

    2. Be ready to answer at CAB:
        - What is the purpose of the topic?
        - How many partitions do you need?
        - If org-scoped, why?

    3. After CAB approval, open a PR in saas-kafka-artifacts (see deployment reference below).


